{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>A boil.</b> A term of heating — that the flesh grows hot from a lesion that comes upon it because of a blow, not because of fire (Ḥullin 8)." "<b>And it heals.</b> The boil raised a scab, and in its place another lesion arose."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:06:08.560518517Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}